# {{PROJECT}} vulnerability experiment

This local repository is a neutral baseline for investigating a bounded production component without disclosing an expected verdict or known vulnerability mechanism.

- Project: `{{PROJECT}}`
- Version: `{{VERSION}}`
- Commit: `{{COMMIT}}`
- Component: `{{COMPONENT}}`

`experiment.yml` records the initial claim boundary, safety properties, source pin, common agent configuration, and leakage rules. Tool choices, solver settings, dependency closure, bounds, and replay commands may evolve during investigation.

Upstream source is materialized separately and remains untracked. A confirmed production violation requires a convincing analysis trace and successful replay against a fresh unmodified pinned build with a useful negative control and checker-sanity test. Inconclusive work may be reported concisely as `unknown`.
